OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785944889
OL,3,CRare African chicks hatch at zoo in
OL,4,Chistoric first
OL,6,FA UK zoo has have successfully hatched
OL,7,Ffive endangered chicks for the first
OL,8,Ftime in its 95-year history.
OL,10,FThe secretarybird chicks were born at
OL,11,FChester Zoo to parents John and Jolene
OL,12,Fas part of an international effort to
OL,13,Fsave Africa's rarest birds of prey.
OL,15,FOnly three other secretarybird chicks
OL,16,Fhave hatched across Europe's breeding
OL,17,Fprogramme in the past 12 months, where
OL,18,Fjust 79 of the birds remain.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
