PN,36802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785944889
OL,3,CRare African chicks hatch at zoo in
OL,4,Chistoric first
OL,6,FKeepers hand-reared the initial chicks
OL,7,Fto closely document their development,
OL,8,Fbefore John and Jolene successfully
OL,9,Fhatched and raised three more
OL,10,Fthemselves.
OL,12,FBird keeper Jamie Cartwright-Stock
OL,13,Fcalled the outcome an "incredible
OL,14,Fachievement," adding that data
OL,15,Fgathered at the zoo will now be shared
OL,16,Fglobally to boost breeding success
OL,17,Facross Europe.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
