OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785944889
OL,3,CRare African chicks hatch at zoo in
OL,4,Chistoric first
OL,6,FSecretarybirds - known for hunting on
OL,7,Ffoot and stomping venomous prey - have
OL,8,Fseen wild populations plummet to as
OL,9,Ffew as 6,700 due to habitat loss.
OL,11,FThe species was officially listed as
OL,12,F'endangered' on the IUCN Red List in
OL,13,F2020.
OL,15,FAndrew Owen, Head of Birds at Chester
OL,16,FZoo, said: "Every chick hatched in
OL,17,Fconservation zoos is becoming
OL,18,Fincreasingly important for the future
OL,19,Fof this remarkable species.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
